  "sections": {
    "BASICS": {
      "present": true,
      "status": "content",
      "content_blocks": [],
      "subsections": {
        "OVERVIEW": {
          "present": true,
          "status": "content",
          "source_heading": "OVERVIEW",
          "canonical_heading": "OVERVIEW",
          "content_blocks": [
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Beta-2 agonist inhaler toxicosis occurs when dogs chew and puncture pressurized inhalers containing albuterol (salbutamol), levalbuterol, or salmeterol.",
              "pdf_page": 254,
              "printed_page": 172,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Loss of beta-2 adrenergic selectivity with overdose results in beta-1 stimulation (sinus tachycardia). Failure of the myocardium to effectively oxygenate during extreme periods of tachycardia can result in other tachyarrhy thmias such as ventricular premature contractions (VPCs) and ventricular tachycardia.",
              "pdf_page": 254,
              "printed_page": 172,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Generalized adrenergic stimulation releases catecholamines that exacerbate cardiovascular (CV) stimulation, stimulate the CNS and respiratory systems, and can result in significant intracellular trans location of potassium and phosphorus.",
              "pdf_page": 254,
              "printed_page": 172,
              "column": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Propellants are now hydrofluoroalkanes (HFAs) and are expected to sensitize the myocardium less to catecholamines than older chlorofluorocarbon propellants.",
              "pdf_page": 254,
              "printed_page": 172,
              "column": 1
            }
          ]
        },
        "DEFINITION": {
          "present": false,
          "status": "missing",
          "source_heading": null,
          "canonical_heading": "DEFINITION",
          "content_blocks": []
        },
